  "description": "Luke and Threepio follow runaway R2-D2 into the desert wastes of Tatooine. There they run afoul of fearsome Tusken Raiders, who are in turn frightened away by Luke's desert friend, an old hermit named Ben Kenobi. R2-D2 is now able to play a pre-recorded message from Princess Leia, who desperately needs Jedi Knight Kenobi's help to transport stolen Death Star readouts to her Rebel allies. Ben asks Luke to join him, but the conflicted farmboy, aching to leave a mundane life on Tatooine, isn't sure he can abandon his work responsibilities..."
